    "turn_idx": 71,
    "turn_text": "And I think and we talk about this all the time that I think there are certain things that that we need a local or a state or a federal government to do and there are certain things that local state federal governments do well. I'm not always sure that that the bureaucracy of the educational system is one of the things government at any level actually does well.",
